                "name": "Chimkins",
                "group_id": "grp_b09525bf-4e83-4f3e-9231-0df3dac38dd6",
                "description": "ChimkinsVRC is a small VRChat Worlds game development team. Our primary goal is to make PC quality experiences accessible to all platforms on VRChat with enough depth to rival that of full size Virtual Reality titles. We have many projects in the works and are excited to share them with everyone, so come by and visit us at our booth!\n\nWe currently have 4 worlds released publicly:\n- Zombie Survival\n- Deagle Duel\n- The Hunt: Remastered\n- The Hunt",
